{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1569","id":4059230713,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87x8vH5","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1569","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1569.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1569.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1569","number":1569,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[V1][P0][API-01] Converge runtime API on /api/learning/**","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- make `/api/learning/**` the only backend namespace used by the Paper Workspace runtime adapter\n- keep the PR4-named frontend surface as a thin compatibility mapper owned by `learning-runtime`, with retirement date `2026-09-30`\n- preserve canonical auth/error and runtime/product/fallback posture instead of deriving accepted, provisional, or blocked state\n- add fail-closed route and frontend contracts that prevent `/api/pr4/**` from returning as a backend namespace\n- add an MSW-off disposable localhost gateway smoke for login → workspace → question → session attempt/review → review queue\n\nIssue: #1565  \nParent: #1563\n\n## Why\n\nThe frontend adapter called `/api/pr4/**`, while the real gateway registers only `/api/learning/**`. That left the Paper Workspace mock-backed and produced requests for routes that do not exist. This change converges network traffic on the registered learning runtime without adding a second business implementation.\n\n## Contract and retirement\n\nThe canonical contract and compatibility retirement plan are documented in `docs/architecture/runtime-api-learning-canonical-v1.md`.\n\nThe compatibility adapter:\n\n- performs no direct `fetch`\n- delegates only to `src/api/learningRuntimeApi.js`\n- owns no auth, persistence, posture, or lifecycle decisions\n- has owner `learning-runtime`\n- retires after `2026-09-30`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `git diff --check` — pass\n- targeted ESLint for all changed JS/MJS files — pass\n- affected regression set — 9 suites, 78 tests passed\n- final namespace contracts — 2 suites, 12 tests passed\n- `vite build` — pass\n- `npm run smoke:api-1565` — PASS\n  - MSW disabled\n  - disposable in-memory non-production handlers\n  - localhost real gateway and route registry\n  - missing-token protected route returns 401 `auth_required`\n  - login, workspace, question, attempt/review, and review queue return 200\n  - `/api/pr4/papers` returns 404 `endpoint_not_found`\n  - no remote writes or provider calls\n\nSmoke receipt: `artifacts/api-1565/msw-off-learning-gateway-smoke.json`\n\n## Boundaries\n\nThis PR is outside Campaign A #1550 and does not alter its child list or policy. It performs no remote Supabase, Storage, Vector, or RAG writes; no PDF upload; no `question_bank` import; no public display; no provider/VLM call; and no source, rights, acceptance, or release-state mutation.","created_at":"2026-07-15T09:17:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T02:17:59Z","closed_at":"2026-07-16T02:07:15Z","merged_at"